THis is the Qoraa App

Flow:

1- vendor(s) register themselves as providers(QoraaVendors)
    * set title
    * set date range
    * image
    * foods being choosen in a Qoraa
    
2- There are four tasks (located at register_tasks.py) running every day
    start_morning_qoraa
        * creates platform's default qoraa at 11:00 AM
        * creates all vendors qoraas if date range matches, for those vendors who are QoraaVendor
    end_morining_qoraa
        * chooses a winner and random foods of the vendor
        * ends all running qoraas at 12:00 AM 

    start_evening_qoraa
        * works the same as start_morning_qoraa
    end_evening_qoraa
        * works the same as end evening qoraa
    
3- user collects his Qoraa.foods to Cart
    views.py: CollectQoraaApiView...

4- chooses payment method 'qoraa'
    order is created and marked as paid
    * no revenue for vendor should be added due to this